<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-TOULOUSE GRAND PRIX FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-TOULOUSE GRAND PRIX FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>TOULOUSE, France 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results in</p>
<p>the $400,000 Toulouse Grand Prix men's tennis tournament on</p>
<p>Tuesday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Lionel Roux (France) beat Andrea Gaudenzi (Italy) 6-2 6-3</p>
<p>Orlin Stanoichev (Bulgaria) beat Alex O'Brien (U.S.) 6-2 4-6</p>
<p>7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>Jacco Eltingh (Netherlands) beat 6-Paul Haarhuis (Netherlands)</p>
<p>4-6 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>1-Marcelo Rios (Chile) beat Frederic Vitoux (France) 5-2,</p>
<p>Vitoux retired injured</p>
<p>Thierry Guardiola (France) beat Olivier Mutis (France) 6-1 4-6 6-4</p>
</text>
